00:20:00.732 --> 00:20:01.800
Okay, okay, let's hit

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.535
one and show everyone.

00:20:04.269 --> 00:20:05.871
Come on, big brother, time to cast the net!

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.374
You throw it out in circles,

00:20:10.008 --> 00:20:11.176
and then you cast it in rounds.

00:20:11.176 --> 00:20:12.778
This open space

00:20:12.778 --> 00:20:14.179
at the fishing power plant

00:20:14.179 --> 00:20:15.514
is for when we 're

00:20:15.514 --> 00:20:17.382
