00:22:55.073 --> 00:22:57.542
You know, recycling is divided into several levels.

00:22:57.542 --> 00:22:58.176
One is that

00:22:58.176 --> 00:22:59.778
after you recycle the item, you

00:22:59.778 --> 00:23:01.380
weigh it and sell it to someone else.

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:01.847
Another

00:23:01.847 --> 00:23:03.014
is that you process it to a semi-finished product

00:23:03.014 --> 00:23:04.182
and then give it to someone else

00:23:04.182 --> 00:23:05.250
for further processing and analysis

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:06.718
. For example, you could break it down

00:23:06.718 --> 00:23:07.886
and separate it into

00:23:07.886 --> 00:23:09.054
different elements.

00:23:09.054 --> 00:23:10.021
But actually,

00:23:10.021 --> 00:23:11.523
there's another way to

00:23:11.523 --> 00:23:12.357
recycle glass

00:23:12.357 --> 00:23:14.092
. Taiwan has been recycling glass for many years

00:23:14.092 --> 00:23:15.627
, and there 's

00:23:15.627 --> 00:23:16.328
the famous Chun Chi Glass.

00:23:16.328 --> 00:23:18.196
Many people in Taiwan recycle glass

00:23:18.196 --> 00:23:20.031
and turn it into paving stones

00:23:20.031 --> 00:23:22.100
, making parks look sparkly.

00:23:22.100 --> 00:23:23.168
There are many recycling methods.

00:23:23.168 --> 00:23:24.236
But let me

00:23:24.236 --> 00:23:25.504
tell you, I'll reveal a way to make money.

00:23:25.504 --> 00:23:26.872
We're currently lacking

00:23:26.872 --> 00:23:28.940
people who can make products from recycled materials.

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:29.541
Look at this glass.

00:23:29.541 --> 00:23:31.610
If you just lay it on paving stones,

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:32.544
you can sell it by the kilogram.

00:23:32.544 --> 00:23:33.979
But if you can

00:23:33.979 --> 00:23:36.014
recycle the glass and make it into products,

00:23:36.014 --> 00:23:37.115
designers

00:23:37.115 --> 00:23:38.583
can turn it into products

00:23:38.583 --> 00:23:39.885
, or make it into something

00:23:39.885 --> 00:23:40.652
truly valuable.

00:23:40.652 --> 00:23:41.586
Because, in fact, we in Taiwan... Taiwan's

00:23:41.586 --> 00:23:42.788
recycling efforts are quite impressive.

00:23:42.788 --> 00:23:44.489
They've managed to turn Taiwan's recycling

00:23:44.489 --> 00:23:45.690
into numerous products.

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:47.526
Many unemployed designers

00:23:47.526 --> 00:23:49.661
, if they understand glass

00:23:49.661 --> 00:23:51.396
and can create excellent product designs,

00:23:51.396 --> 00:23:52.664
can contact this company.

00:23:52.664 --> 00:23:54.533
Because energy use

00:23:54.533 --> 00:23:55.934
and recycling

00:23:55.934 --> 00:23:56.802
are industry-wide processes

00:23:56.802 --> 00:23:57.602
; there

00:23:57.602 --> 00:23:58.437
