00:23:59.271 --> 00:24:00.405
, recycling , and reuse.

00:24:00.405 --> 00:24:01.973
After reuse, the material can return to

00:24:01.973 --> 00:24:03.375
the cycle,

00:24:03.375 --> 00:24:04.709
generating electricity

00:24:04.709 --> 00:24:05.577
and other things

00:24:05.577 --> 00:24:07.813
. It's a very large circle.

00:24:07.813 --> 00:24:09.781
The reason recycling is difficult

00:24:09.781 --> 00:24:11.183
is that

00:24:11.183 --> 00:24:12.384
sometimes the cost of recycling

00:24:12.384 --> 00:24:13.752
exceeds the cost of production .

00:24:13.752 --> 00:24:14.753
So you see, even with glass recycling

00:24:14.753 --> 00:24:16.588
, sometimes it might be one dollar per kilogram

00:24:16.588 --> 00:24:18.089
, or sometimes

00:24:18.089 --> 00:24:19.357
the market price varies.

00:24:19.357 --> 00:24:20.959
Sometimes you have to pay someone one dollar,

00:24:20.959 --> 00:24:21.493
you understand?

00:24:21.493 --> 00:24:22.861
Sometimes I give someone one kilogram

00:24:22.861 --> 00:24:23.395
and they give me one dollar;

00:24:23.395 --> 00:24:25.130
sometimes I hire someone to collect 10 kilograms

00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:25.997
and I give them 10 dollars.

00:24:25.997 --> 00:24:27.199
But if you can

00:24:27.199 --> 00:24:28.934
turn this into a product,

00:24:28.934 --> 00:24:30.702
it's not calculated by kilograms,

00:24:30.702 --> 00:24:32.704
it's calculated by the product value.

00:24:32.704 --> 00:24:33.805
We lack this kind of talent.

00:24:33.805 --> 00:24:35.340
In Taiwan, many industrial design

00:24:35.340 --> 00:24:36.942
teachers

00:24:36.942 --> 00:24:38.443
haven't properly explained to their students

00:24:38.443 --> 00:24:40.145
how to seize this opportunity,

00:24:40.145 --> 00:24:41.079
the energy market,

00:24:41.079 --> 00:24:42.414
and follow Teacher Chao

00:24:42.414 --> 00:24:43.248
.

00:24:43.248 --> 00:24:45.050
Or, when applying to this company,

00:24:45.050 --> 00:24:45.817
just tell them,

00:24:45.817 --> 00:24:46.384
"I'll tell you..."

00:24:46.384 --> 00:24:48.253
I can help you turn this glass into something

00:24:48.253 --> 00:24:48.920
that doesn't require selling it for more than

00:24:48.920 --> 00:24:50.722
a kilogram. You can sell it for 10 yuan.

00:24:50.722 --> 00:24:52.123
The boss will kneel down to thank you.

00:24:52.123 --> 00:24:52.657
Would you?

00:24:52.657 --> 00:24:53.391
The boss 's

00:24:53.391 --> 00:24:53.959
daughter said

00:24:53.959 --> 00:24:54.993
the boss would kneel down to thank you.

00:24:54.993 --> 00:24:56.728
As long as you can come up with a solution

00:24:56.728 --> 00:24:59.097
to turn it into a recyclable product,

00:24:59.097 --> 00:25:00.265
follow Teacher Chao.

00:25:00.265 --> 00:25:01.566
Do you want to join me in recycling?

00:25:01.566 --> 00:25:03.001
It 's better than

00:25:03.001 --> 00:25:03.969
doing

00:25:03.969 --> 00:25:04.636
fraud.

00:25:04.636 --> 00:25:06.471
Recycling has a market. Believe me,

00:25:07.472 --> 00:25:08.473
it really is.

00:25:08.473 --> 00:25:09.608
If

00:25:09.608 --> 00:25:10.509
you're really serious about it, don't do it casually.

00:25:10.509 --> 00:25:11.309
Make sure it's real. It's real that

00:25:11.309 --> 00:25:13.912
you can raise fish, shrimp, and even generate

00:25:13.912 --> 00:25:15.547
electricity.

00:25:15.547 --> 00:25:18.149
Don't brag about receiving subsidies.

00:25:18.149 --> 00:25:19.417
Otherwise, it

00:25:19.417 --> 00:25:20.785
will seem like you're just doing it casually,

00:25:20.785 --> 00:25:22.354
and all the fish will die.

00:25:22.354 --> 00:25:24.556
Our elders used to say, "

00:25:24.556 --> 00:25:26.057
You earn money faster by yourself. You

00:25:26.057 --> 00:25:27.792
have to earn it yourself." Making money is pretty fast!

00:25:28.059 --> 00:25:29.494
The prices at this site

00:25:29.494 --> 00:25:31.329
this year are all pretty good.

00:25:31.329 --> 00:25:33.465
I feel like I could describe it in three words:

00:25:33.465 --> 00:25:34.432
making a killing!

00:25:36.902 --> 00:25:38.036
It's all thanks to your own hard work.

00:25:38.036 --> 00:25:40.405
Just two tries and you've really made a fortune!

00:25:40.405 --> 00:25:42.440
In this episode about fish-electro-co-production,

00:25:42.440 --> 00:25:43.975
it's basically

00:25:43.975 --> 00:25:46.278
impossible to

00:25:46.278 --> 00:25:47.679
film this site without it

00:25:47.679 --> 00:25:49.781
. We can call the person at this site a "landlord."

00:25:49.781 --> 00:25:50.749
I heard

00:25:50.749 --> 00:25:51.950
that everything

00:25:51.950 --> 00:25:53.285
here belongs to you, right ?

00:25:53.285 --> 00:25:55.587
Unlike you, you're basically renting out the land to them to build,

00:25:55.587 --> 00:25:58.089
and then you get a cut of the electricity fees?

00:25:58.089 --> 00:25:59.391
You're just pure land

00:25:59.391 --> 00:26:01.927
; we only

00:26:01.927 --> 00:26:02.794
charge rent.

00:26:02.794 --> 00:26:04.563
We have to raise the fish.

00:26:04.563 --> 00:26:06.932
Because this is a relatively positive

00:26:06.932 --> 00:26:09.301
, good site,

00:26:09.301 --> 00:26:10.602
I'd like to hear some gossip . Are

00:26:10.602 --> 00:26:12.337
there any other people in the industry

00:26:12.337 --> 00:26:14.539
who are doing this poorly? Yes,

00:26:14.539 --> 00:26:17.442
some are just building on one side,

00:26:19.144 --> 00:26:20.812
which isn't good.

